## 🛠️ **Technical Implementation Stack**

### **Primary Libraries**
```javascript
// Core animation engines
- GSAP 3.12+ with ScrollTrigger, MotionPath, Physics2D
- Anime.js 3.2+ for micro-interactions
- Framer Motion for React-specific animations
- Three.js for 3D rope physics (optional advanced feature)
```

### **Animation Utilities**
```javascript
// Custom hooks and helpers
- hooks/useClimbingPhysics.js - Rope and gear physics
- hooks/useAltitudeEffects.js - Scroll-based environmental changes  
- hooks/useEquipmentSounds.js - Audio feedback system
- utils/climbingEasing.js - Custom easing curves
- utils/weatherEffects.js - Atmospheric animation helpers
```

### **Performance Optimization**
```javascript
// Climbing-themed performance patterns
- useReducedMotion() respects accessibility (safety first!)
- Equipment "caching" for repeated animations
- Route planning (animation queuing) system
- Emergency bailout for resource-heavy animations
- "Lightweight gear" mode for mobile devices
```

